{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8ee1affc69b5438b2f3e3e615cc634d07e21d1cba325cf9d7e095edef745a71e", "ja": "（今日はコスプレグラビア企画の仕事だ。\n貴音は、盲導犬の仕事を紹介する動画を撮影する）", "zh": "（今天是角色扮演写真企划的工作。\n贵音要拍摄介绍导盲犬工作的宣传视频。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "20fded798792f62b24bd9864b6d0f27c526272373e7fbd4f541932f8d9da8b5f", "ja": "では、{$P$}。\n目を閉じてください。", "zh": "那么，{$P$}。\n请闭上眼睛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1002_p", "source_sha256": "95ca14f9fefea5ef1bd3eceec6e6c2b829b7f872ebc03a75ac8c9deffaa9f0e3", "ja": "……えっ、なんで？", "zh": "……诶，为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "a383ef69a3bba3e5b8c5f8d686607dcb1847afcc14a7bc1c455c4d1d671a850a", "ja": "本日は、盲導犬について、わかりやすく説明し、\n理解を深めてもらうという内容です。", "zh": "今天的内容是，用通俗易懂的方式介绍导盲犬，加深大家对它们的了解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "524b7d7811e43aa226517218724f0d8ff3f42658ac52e078b53320d63d950e28", "ja": "ならば、盲導犬がどれほど難しい仕事をしているのか\n私も、一度体験してみようかと。", "zh": "既然如此，我也想亲自体验一次，看看导盲犬的工作究竟有多么艰难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5632ffb87fd19d77816096b470e16aa8df1c5a0e76af0d12f315b76ae9fc8c95", "ja": "なるほど？　盲導犬をやってみるということか。\n誰かの目の代わりをするのは、確かに大変そうだ。", "zh": "原来如此？你是想试试看当导盲犬吗？\n代替某个人的眼睛，确实听起来挺辛苦的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1006_p", "source_sha256": "bb857be1830595e78d21a97c585325e0a9f651b2f1e193340d48f89b9811babe", "ja": "じゃあ、盲導犬のパートナーをすればいいんだな。\nよ、よし……。", "zh": "那我当导盲犬的搭档就行了吧。  \n好、好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1007_p", "source_sha256": "76da1584678e6f82ae0a2bddd2e8e36b6437391847cfb2850b799594634cf1f5", "ja": "これでいいか？", "zh": "这样就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "777987f592e5c43961814c1ef7dcf41103c56517db3bb3e83c8067b6d1a506fb", "ja": "ありがとうございます。それでは、手を失礼しますね。\n……まずは、どこに向かいましょう？", "zh": "谢谢您。那么，失礼了，我来牵您的手吧。\n……首先，我们该往哪里走呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1009_p", "source_sha256": "69fc5826e7d2ab10ea088fe4b28ef5fd92361a946d32ac77f52b7056990bcde8", "ja": "そうだなぁ……。\nカバンを置いたベンチまで連れて行ってもらえるか？", "zh": "是啊……  \n能请你带我到放着包的长椅那里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "1603cd4fa11342ea4db09ae77d12ef4c5ceff0020c39816673280af75efcb92c", "ja": "わかりました。こちらです。\n足元に気をつけて、ゆっくりと歩いてください……。", "zh": "明白了。请往这边走。\n请注意脚下，慢慢走……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1011_p", "source_sha256": "11263b4e381de72e1063de1a6ad40ef3e207b0f892b11a0df9bfca69c8ce7d62", "ja": "（貴音が手を引いてくれてるが、\n何も見えないからか不安だな。足元もちょっと……）", "zh": "（贵音牵着我的手，可是什么都看不见，还是让人有些不安。脚下也有点……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "a4b437ef77655ee17830d0da2f04d3d8bbe5126cb1bcfe6f5abfdd926872436e", "ja": "ふむ、これはなかなか……。", "zh": "嗯，这个还真是相当……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cacdf3cf3e82651d87041bf741dc5df12026d3d75ecf225b3c206f2362a8f300", "ja": "ん？　何かが足に触れて……あ、貴音のしっぽか？\n……うわぁっ！？", "zh": "嗯？好像有什么碰到了脚……啊，是贵音的尾巴吗？\n……哇啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "bbd312bb26a6038766e07a4332577f222632686435d02bb63acc308b7c607fae", "ja": "……っ！", "zh": "……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1015_se", "source_sha256": "974138fa5cc105e693f6f997db3559de9bc6543ef132f7876b20614f7d795594", "ja": "ドテーンッ！", "zh": "扑通！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1016_p", "source_sha256": "101155fdceb40c908e42792f52497bccd9f3b06814d0abee3be82612c76e376c", "ja": "いたたっ……。\n悪い。何かに足を取られて……。", "zh": "好疼……。\n抱歉。好像被什么东西绊了一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "c60e177f791ffe6263ca338bba5ad2bebfb60a2d1b4a7a2ae891ef10647f5ef3", "ja": "大丈夫ですか？　細心の注意を払っていたつもり\nでしたが……こんなところに木の根があったとは。", "zh": "您没事吧？我自认已经格外小心了，\n没想到……这种地方居然会有树根。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "b3b92fc50ec13de7083f01fb0e9902c616e64c43948b8b7a1586694949f90ae1", "ja": "生半可な技術ではないと、改めてわかりました。\n盲導犬の仕事は、とても素晴らしいですね。", "zh": "我再次明白了，这绝不是半吊子的技术。\n导盲犬的工作，真是太了不起了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a0329e93d66510d718efa10a7624da583e9b2cfda7fcc2eb9e8d442db6f15bcc", "ja": "そうだな。貴音の力で、\n盲導犬のことを、たくさんの人に知ってもらおう。", "zh": "是啊。就用贵音的力量，\n让更多人了解导盲犬吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "0ea6290f3b0d24fb48ca2de872bd37ac91e1b8eaa5ffbaeebaf20f2835f7599b", "ja": "ええ。盲導犬への尊敬を込めて……\n私も、このお仕事を立派に果たしましょう。", "zh": "是的。怀着对导盲犬的敬意……\n我也会出色地完成这份工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0483_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b25bd934e9f67a57f243d50cc046f1f177f3c013101f239e516b9a3a42fdc338", "ja": "（貴音の丁寧な説明と盲導犬の実演で、わかりやすい\n動画に仕上がった。これは注目されそうだな！）", "zh": "（在贵音细致的讲解和导盲犬的示范下，视频做得通俗易懂。这下应该会引起关注了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
